why not! Current demo PAKs drop dead after 30-apr-1991.

With wholesale of that Sony drive being between 400 and 450 (@ quantity 1, 
internal model ), street price isn't that much more! remember it IS a 
PC drive too, so there is SERIOUS discounting.


