    1 Pt 2 Pt polar
    2 copy mirrorang
    3 1 roll afactor dist mul
    xya 1 Pt qa
    2 Pt 3 Pt polar
    2 Pt 1 Pt polar
    2 copy mirrorang
    3 1 roll afactor dist mul
    xya 2 Pt qa
    2 Pt
}def

